    <title>Can an Ignition Model Beat the Fire Weather Index over Indonesian Peat?</title>
    <meta name="description" content="An adversarial review of a fire and haze early-warning case: average precision against AUC on a 3.8% event, a spatially blocked refit, an audit of the CEMS FWI comparison, and back-trajectory attribution replayed over 9,594 receptor-days." />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;600;700&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" />
  </head>
